VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the different elements that need to fit together&nbsp; uh because one of the let\'s say distinguishing and&nbsp;&nbsp; um factor something that is pretty evident&nbsp; from everything we have seen so far is this&nbsp;&nbsp; uh the fact that this relies on a VR headset&nbsp; in order to perform part of that capturing.&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[03:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
