VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'based off the head and controller positions in&nbsp; 3D space. Um Meta have done their own versions of&nbsp;&nbsp; this. Um but what we\'ve often found is uh there\'s&nbsp; some cheats along the way. Uh so they have just&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[08:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
