[09:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'would stretch the length of bones to make sure&nbsp; footplanting landed and things like that. Um,&nbsp;&nbsp; but obviously that doesn\'t if it doesn\'t look&nbsp; good with an animated character for animation,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

